{"message":"I can help you compare the upgrade options, close your Light Blue Account, and open a personal savings account. Before I access or change your account information, please verify your identity by providing your full name and any two of these four details: date of birth, email address, phone number, or address.

Based on the options I found, the strongest savings choice for a $25,000 balance appears to be the Gold Account, which has a 5.5% base APY and a $10,000 standard minimum balance. A qualifying linked checking account or eligible credit card may add further bonuses. The Bluest Account offers premium checking benefits, including 2.25% APY, a dedicated personal banker, wire-fee benefits, and ATM-fee rebates, but I’ll confirm your eligibility and any closure fee before taking action.

Please also confirm whether you want the Bluest Account and Gold Account, or tell me which checking and savings account classes you prefer."}

